==Rules==
{{ColosseumRule|Uniform Motion|25}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Imperator Sael]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*3 [[Darkmadillo]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 66.67~70 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Crustaceous Scissorex]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.
*2 [[Imperator Sael]]s spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 80~83.33 seconds<sup>2,400f~2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Director Kurosawah]] spawns after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Star Peng]] spawns after 110 seconds<sup>3,300f</sup>.
*1 [[Galactic Overseer Nyandam]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threat of this stage is not just Crustaceous Scissorex, it's Crustaceous Scissorex with over quadruple the movement rate. Dark Emperor Nyandam and Director Kurosawah are also moving much faster than they otherwise would be expected to, and this mix of swift threats can quickly overwhelm players. Many of your normal options, such as [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], will have their speed reduced, significantly reducing their performance.

[[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] can benefit from the speed change, and is useful for eliminating the early peons, as can [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]]. [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] can help with many of the aliens, and an [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien]] [[:Category:Tanker-class Cats|Tank]] will provide protection against the boss while your attackers bite chunks out of its health over time.

